<h2 id='what-is-moosend'>🧪 What Is Moosend?</h2>

Moosend is a cloud-based email marketing and automation platform founded in 2011. It positions itself as an affordable Mailchimp and Klaviyo alternative, emphasizing visual automation builders, e-commerce triggers, and subscriber segmentation. Its subscriber-based pricing model (rather than email-send-volume pricing) is a meaningful advantage for clinics that send frequent follow-up sequences without massive lists.

In the aesthetics space, email marketing sits at the intersection of client retention, upsell, and reactivation — three areas where most practices leave measurable revenue on the table. The question we set out to answer: does Moosend have enough firepower to run those campaigns reliably, or does it buckle under the operational demands of a real med spa?

